te, the issue text reaches it\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m  4 \u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;242m# only as a file (through `env:`, never through `${{ }}` in a command or p\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;242mrompt), and its egress is filtered. The\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m  5 \u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;242m# change crosses to a second job as a compressed, base64-encoded job outpu\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;242mt, and only that second job has the token\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m  6 \u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;242m# that pushes the branch and opens the pull request.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m… +159 lines \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mCounting issue title/body references\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m  ⎿  $ claude --help 2>&1 | grep -n -A3 \"max-turns\" ; echo \"grep exit=$?\"\r\u001b[16C\u001b[2B4m 50s · ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246m54.3k tokens\u001b[43Gthought for 11s)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[34;1H\u001b[32;3H"]
